  "description": "Server-side character store for SetNet: a generic CharacterServer<TChar> over any IDocumentStore — create/list-by-account/get/save/rename, per-account slot limit, optional unique names, and soft-delete with a restore window. Subclass CharacterBase (or use its Extra bag) to add ANY custom fields (e.g. a per-character VipUntil) with no schema change. Depends on SetNet + SetNet.Persistence.",
